  "testament": "new",
  "chapter": 12,
  "sortOrder": 46012,
  "verseCount": 31,
  "aliases": [
    "1 Cor",
    "1Cor",
    "1 Co",
    "1Co"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Now concerning spiritual gifts, brethren, I would not have you ignorant.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Ye know that ye were Gentiles, carried away unto these dumb idols, even as ye were led.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Wherefore I give you to understand, that no man speaking by the Spirit of God calleth Jesus accursed: and that no man can say that Jesus is the Lord, but by the Holy Ghost.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Now there are diversities of gifts, but the same Spirit.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And there are differences of administrations, but the same Lord.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "And there are diversities of operations, but it is the same God which worketh all in all.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "But the manifestation of the Spirit is given to every man to profit withal.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "For to one is given by the Spirit the word of wisdom; to another the word of knowledge by the same Spirit;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "To another faith by the same Spirit; to another the gifts of healing by the same Spirit;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "To another the working of miracles; to another prophecy; to another discerning of spirits; to another divers kinds of tongues; to another the interpretation of tongues:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "But all these worketh that one and the selfsame Spirit, dividing to every man severally as he will.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "For as the body is one, and hath many members, and all the members of that one body, being many, are one body: so also is Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "For by one Spirit are we all baptized into one body, whether we be Jews or Gentiles, whether we be bond or free; and have been all made to drink into one Spirit.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "For the body is not one member, but many.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "If the foot shall say, Because I am not the hand, I am not of the body; is it therefore not of the body?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "And if the ear shall say, Because I am not the eye, I am not of the body; is it therefore not of the body?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "If the whole body were an eye, where were the hearing? If the whole were hearing, where were the smelling?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "But now hath God set the members every one of them in the body, as it hath pleased him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "And if they were all one member, where were the body?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "But now are they many members, yet but one body.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "And the eye cannot say unto the hand, I have no need of thee: nor again the head to the feet, I have no need of you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "Nay, much more those members of the body, which seem to be more feeble, are necessary:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And those members of the body, which we think to be less honourable, upon these we bestow more abundant honour; and our uncomely parts have more abundant comeliness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "For our comely parts have no need: but God hath tempered the body together, having given more abundant honour to that part which lacked:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "That there should be no schism in the body; but that the members should have the same care one for another.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "And whether one member suffer, all the members suffer with it; or one member be honoured, all the members rejoice with it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "Now ye are the body of Christ, and members in particular.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "And God hath set some in the church, first apostles, secondarily prophets, thirdly teachers, after that miracles, then gifts of healings, helps, governments, diversities of tongues.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-029",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 29,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:29",
      "numberLabel": "29",
      "text": "Are all apostles? are all prophets? are all teachers? are all workers of miracles?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:29",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:29"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-030",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 30,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:30",
      "numberLabel": "30",
      "text": "Have all the gifts of healing? do all speak with tongues? do all interpret?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:30",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-031",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 31,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:31",
      "numberLabel": "31",
      "text": "But covet earnestly the best gifts: and yet shew I unto you a more excellent way.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Corinthians 12:31",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-corinthians:12:31"
      }
    }
  ],
